{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1co-16-1","title":"1 Corinthians 16:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He exhorts them to relieve the want of the brethren at Jerusalem. 10 Commends Timothy; 13 and after friendly admonitions, 16 concludes his epistle with divers salutations.</p>\n<p>concerning. Ac 11:28,30; 24:17; Ro 15:25,26; 2Co 8:1-9:15; Ga 2:10 the saints. Ac 9:41; Ro 12:13; 2Co 9:12-15; Phm 1:5,7; Heb 6:10; 1Jo 3:17 the churches. Ac 16:6; 18:23; Ga 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-2","title":"1 Corinthians 16:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the first. Lu 24:1; Joh 20:19,26; Ac 20:7; Re 1:10 as God. Ge 26:12; 30:27,30; 32:10; 33:11; De 8:18; 15:11-14; 2Ch 31:10 Hag 2:16-19; Mal 3:9,10; Mr 12:41-44; 14:8; Lu 16:10 2Co 8:1-3,12-15 that. 2Co 8:11; 9:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-3","title":"1 Corinthians 16:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>when. 4:19-21; 11:34 whomsoever. Ac 6:1-6; 2Co 8:19-24 liberality. Gr. gift. 2Co 8:4,6,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-4","title":"1 Corinthians 16:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Ro 15:25; 2Co 8:4,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-5","title":"1 Corinthians 16:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>when. Ac 19:21; 20:1-3; 2Co 1:15-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-6","title":"1 Corinthians 16:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>winter. Ac 27:12; 28:11; Tit 3:12 that ye. Ac 15:3; 17:15; 20:38; 21:5; Ro 15:24; 2Co 1:16; 3Jo 1:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-7","title":"1 Corinthians 16:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>if. 4:19; Pr 19:21; Jer 10:23; Ac 18:21; Ro 1:10; Jas 4:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-8","title":"1 Corinthians 16:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>at. 15:32 Pentecost. Ex 23:16; Le 23:15-21; Ac 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-9","title":"1 Corinthians 16:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>a great. Ac 19:8-10 door. Ac 14:27; 2Co 2:12; Col 4:3; Re 3:7,8 there. 15:32; Ac 19:9,10; 2Co 1:8-10; Php 3:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-10","title":"1 Corinthians 16:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>if. 4:17; Ac 19:22 without. 11; 1Th 4:12 for. 15:58; Ro 16:21; 2Co 6:1; Php 2:19-22; 1Th 3:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-11","title":"1 Corinthians 16:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>no. 10; Lu 10:16; 1Th 4:8; 1Ti 4:12; Tit 2:15 but. 6; Ac 15:33; 3Jo 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-12","title":"1 Corinthians 16:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>our. 1:12; 3:5,22; Ac 18:24-28; 19:1; Tit 3:4 when. Ec 3:1; Mr 6:21; Ac 24:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-13","title":"1 Corinthians 16:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Watch. Mt 24:42-44; 25:13; 26:41; Mr 13:33-37; 14:37,38; Lu 12:35-40; 21:36 Eph 6:18; Col 4:2; 1Th 5:6; 2Ti 4:5; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8; Re 3:2,3; 16:15 stand. 15:1,2,58; 2Co 1:24; Ga 5:1; Php 1:27; 4:1; Col 1:23; 4:12; 1Th 3:8 2Th 2:15 quit. 9:25-27; 14:20; 1Sa 4:9; 2Sa 10:12; 1Ch 19:13; Eph 6:13-17; 1Ti 6:12 2Ti 2:3-5; 4:7; Heb 11:32-34 be. Jos 1:6,7,9,18; 1Ki 2:2; 1Ch 28:10; Ps 27:14; Isa 35:4; Da 10:19 Da 11:32; Hag 2:4; Zec 8:9,13; 2Co 12:9,10; Eph 6:10; Php 4:13 Col 1:11,12; 2Ti 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-14","title":"1 Corinthians 16:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>8:1; 12:31; 13:1-13; 14:1; Joh 13:34,35; 15:17; Ro 13:8-10; 14:15 Ga 5:13,14,22; Eph 4:1-3; Php 2:1-3; 1Th 3:6,12; 4:9,10; 2Th 1:3 1Ti 1:5; Heb 13:4; 1Pe 4:8; 2Pe 1:7; 1Jo 4:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-15","title":"1 Corinthians 16:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the house. 17; 1:16 the first-fruits. Ro 16:5; Re 14:4 to the. Ac 9:36-41; Ro 12:13; 15:25; 16:2; 2Co 8:4; 9:1,12-15; 1Ti 5:10 Phm 1:7; Heb 6:10; 1Pe 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-16","title":"1 Corinthians 16:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>ye. Eph 5:21; Heb 13:17; 1Pe 5:5 helpeth. 12:28; 1Ch 12:18; Ro 16:3,9; Php 4:3; 3Jo 1:8 laboureth. 3:9; Ro 16:6,12; 1Th 1:3; 2:9; 5:12; 1Ti 5:17; Heb 6:10; Re 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-17","title":"1 Corinthians 16:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>Stephanas. 15 for. 2Co 11:9; Php 2:30; Phm 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-18","title":"1 Corinthians 16:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>they. Pr 25:13,25; Ro 15:32; 2Co 7:6,7,13; Php 2:28; Col 4:8; 1Th 3:6,7 3Jo 1:4 therefore. 1Th 5:12; Php 2:29; Heb 13:7; 3Jo 1:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-19","title":"1 Corinthians 16:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>churches. Ac 19:10; 1Pe 1:1; Re 1:11 Aquila. Ac 18:2,18,26; Ro 16:3,4; 2Ti 4:19 Prisca. the church. Ro 16:5,15; Col 4:15; Phm 1:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-20","title":"1 Corinthians 16:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the brethren. Ro 16:16,21,23; 2Co 13:13; Php 4:22; Phm 1:23,24; Heb 13:24 Greet. 2Co 13:12; 1Th 5:26; 1Pe 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-21","title":"1 Corinthians 16:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>salutation. Ga 6:11; Col 4:18; 2Th 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-22","title":"1 Corinthians 16:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>love. So 1:3,4,7; 3:1-3; 5:16; Isa 5:1; Mt 10:37; 25:40,45; Joh 8:42 Joh 14:15,21,23; 15:24; 16:14; 21:15-17; 2Co 5:14,15; 8:8,9; Ga 5:6 Eph 6:24; Heb 6:10; 1Pe 1:8; 2:7; 1Jo 4:19; 5:1 Anathema.That is, \"Let him be accursed; our Lord cometh,\" i.e., to execute the judgment denounced.</p>\n<p>Mt 25:41,46; Ac 23:14; Ro 9:3; Ga 1:8,9; *Gr: 1Co 12:3; 2Th 1:8,9; Jude 1:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-23","title":"1 Corinthians 16:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ro 16:20,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1co-16-24","title":"1 Corinthians 16:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1CO","chapterStart":16,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":16,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>love. 14; 4:14,15; 2Co 11:11; 12:15; Php 1:8; Re 3:19 Amen. 14:16; Mt 6:13; 28:20</p>"}]}